legal_text = "[center][b][color=#A3BE8C]THE TRIPLETAP™[/color][/b][/center]
[center][i]Multishot Usage, Licensing, and Overkill Authorization Protocol (MULAP) v4.2.7[/i][/center]
-------------------
[color=#777777][i]Acceptance is mandatory and acknowledges understanding of triple-volume fire consequences.[/i][/color]
-------------------
[b]1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW:[/b]  
The TripleTap™ (hereafter “The Tap”) embodies a triad of projectile emission mechanisms, delivering three sequential shots per trigger actuation.
-------------------
[b]2. LICENSE RESTRICTIONS:[/b]  
Each projectile is individually licensed; usage implies tripled fee accumulation and multiplied risk factors.
-------------------
[b]3. PERFORMANCE AND LIABILITY:[/b]  
While The Tap dramatically increases fire volume, it also triples ammunition consumption, recoil effects, and user fatigue probabilities.
-------------------
[b]4. PAYMENT AND FEE STRUCTURE:[/b]  
Fees include:
• Base Weapon Price  
• Triple Ammunition Consumption Levy  
• Advanced Recoil Compensation Surcharge  
-------------------
User assumes all risk of projectile spread, collateral damage, and unexpected enemy aggression.
-------------------
[b]5. DISCLAIMER:[/b]  
The Tap’s triple discharge does not guarantee triple damage, triple satisfaction, or triple user enjoyment.
-------------------
[quote][i]Note: The TripleTap™ fires three times — your patience must as well.[/i][/quote]
-------------------
[center][color=#A3BE8C][b]TripleTap™: Three shots, triple the paperwork.[/b][/color][/center]"
